  "full_text": "Who is Erik?\n\nIssues\n\nNews\n\nVoter Info\n\nContact\n\nGallery\n\nEndorsements\n\nContribute\n\nA PEOPLE-POWERED CAMPAIGN\n\nErik Martin Dilan for New York State Assembly\n\nOur Assemblyman Erik Martin Dilan is leading the fight for working families in Albany—for more affordable housing and child care, safer neighborhoods and a fairer justice system, and standing up to Trump and ICE to protect our immigrant neighbors and everyone who calls New York home.\n\nContribute Meet Erik\n\nRe-elect Erik Martin Dilan, New York State Assembly 54th District\n\nErik’s Priorities\n\nErik Martin Dilan is fighting to protect North Brooklyn families by defending tenants, expanding childcare and health care, reforming sentencing and prisons for fairness and safety, and standing up to Trump’s agenda and ICE.\n\nRead the Issues\n\nGet Involved\n\nKnock doors, make calls, and help us reach voters across the district. Your time can make the margin.\n\nVolunteer With Erik\n\nStay Informed\n\nSign up to receive campaign updates, events, and ways to support Erik’s campaign.\n\nJoin the List\n\nElection Day Countdown\n\nPrimary Election: June 23, 2026\n\n0 Days 0 Hours 0 Minutes 0 Seconds\n\nEvery day counts. Help us reach voters before Election Day.\n\nMake a Difference\n\nOur campaign is powered by grassroots supporters like you.\n\n$25 $50 $100 $250 $500 $1,000 $3,000 Other Amount\n\nSign Up for Campaign Updates\n\nGet the latest news, events, and volunteer opportunities from Team Erik.\n\nGet Updates\n\nYou’ll be redirected to our secure signup form. By providing your contact information, you consent to receive campaign updates from Committee to Elect Erik Dilan. You can opt out at any time.",
